From 1cf65dfb0ad57f8e55f790346c6b2e7900359648 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:35:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: About Lapin UX card, official Start logo list, any
 installed pointer theme

About gets an "About Lapin UX" card (version, build, licence, credits,
links) read from /usr/share/lapin-ux (#63). The Start button list drops the
old Squares and Rabbit pictures: the Lapin UX logo is the default (#60).
Mouse pointer style lists every pointer theme installed on the computer and
applies it with lapin-ux-cursors --theme (#57).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pcon9Yg6dsbuT1QQmuecS1
